  "contentHtml": "<p>#운동 #운동분석 #속력 #야구 #포물선&#160;<br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70f933ace0970fbda56e7fa989045674cbec3e7a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70f933ace0970fbda56e7fa989045674cbec3e7a\" data-origin-width=\"1237\" data-origin-height=\"662\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/976249e0ad7ba55525dcfe68c3b86ebb98da1d43\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/976249e0ad7ba55525dcfe68c3b86ebb98da1d43\" data-origin-width=\"1231\" data-origin-height=\"693\"><div class=\"figcaption\">모바일에서는 일부만 보여집니다. 다운받아서 보면 모두 볼 수 있습니다.</div></div><p><span style=\"color: #777777;\">GIF 파일은 핸드폰에서는 일부만 보여집니다. 핸드폰에서는 다운받아서 보면 모두 볼 수 있습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0704fbfec2d15933e804721303e4804b87d525f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0704fbfec2d15933e804721303e4804b87d525f\" data-origin-width=\"484\" data-origin-height=\"400\"></div><p>타구속도: 162.1 km/h</p><p>발사각도: 29.1도</p><p>초기 발사 높이: 0.6 m</p><p>최고도달 높이: 25.05 m</p><p>최대수평거리: 176.8 m</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>포물선 운동의 초기조건을 입력하면, 최고 높이와 비거리(최대수평거리)를 계산해주는 사이트 입니다.</p><p>회전, 공기저항 등은 요소에 없습니다. 박병호 선수의 경우 비거리가 130m가 나왔는데 야구관람석만 없었다면, 더 멀리 갈수도 있었을 것 같네요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.omnicalculator.com/physics/projectile-motion\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.omnicalculator.com/physics/projectile-motion</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Projectile Motion Calculator\" data-og-description=\"An object follows a parabola because of how its two components of motion - the horizontal and vertical - are affected by gravity. The horizontal component is not affected by gravity at all, and so changes in a constant, linear fashion. The vertical part, h\" data-og-host=\"www.omnicalculator.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.omnicalculator.com/physics/projectile-motion\" data-og-url=\"https://www.omnicalculator.com/physics/projectile-motion\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bTOMky/hyOWW1dl4c/fflEom2Cl81vi5TdgvIb21/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/83kht/hyOWVVxAdx/7qlq4rfWm23KqaKwrQLGfk/img.png?width=1073&amp;height=463&amp;face=0_0_1073_463,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/87Pb6/hyOW21qM8n/HzLNkk68jyHWQ2rTAayjUk/img.jpg?width=425&amp;height=264&amp;face=0_0_425_264\"><a href=\"https://www.omnicalculator.com/physics/projectile-motion\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.omnicalculator.com/physics/projectile-motion\"><div class=\"og-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bTOMky/hyOWW1dl4c/fflEom2Cl81vi5TdgvIb21/img.png?width=1200&amp;height=630&amp;face=0_0_1200_630,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/83kht/hyOWVVxAdx/7qlq4rfWm23KqaKwrQLGfk/img.png?width=1073&amp;height=463&amp;face=0_0_1073_463,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/87Pb6/hyOW21qM8n/HzLNkk68jyHWQ2rTAayjUk/img.jpg?width=425&amp;height=264&amp;face=0_0_425_264)\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Projectile Motion Calculator</p><p class=\"og-desc\">An object follows a parabola because of how its two components of motion - the horizontal and vertical - are affected by gravity. The horizontal component is not affected by gravity at all, and so changes in a constant, linear fashion. The vertical part, h</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.omnicalculator.com</p></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!